  "observations": [
    "Exact signed version86 candidate executed in the existing headless Android16 emulator5558 through ADB/CDP only; no desktop focus/input or visible game/emulator hosts.",
    "v0.85 Home reproduction: UID10235 became LAST with effective APP_BACKGROUND; Android destroyed TCP sockets, native private host observed disconnect. Directory UnknownHostException occurred afterward; cached freezing occurred later.",
    "Exact86 private waiting room retained the same child/RAF counter and process across separate10-second Home, Recents and screen-off checks. The same six-phase journey in a native match retained active game state and advanced native clock by10200/10100/10100ms. Android reported FGS with effective network block NONE; no nonwarning session errors occurred in these transitions.",
    "One disclosed directory-only DNS failure fixture retained19 actual cached rooms, displayed one concise native error without raw exception text, and recovered to19 rooms after a real network Refresh. TCP/gameplay responses were not mocked.",
    "MP actual touch ALL+cycle+Manufacture started both eligible vehicle factories. New real truck IDs and later native subjects proved completion/repeat. STOP-first retained sibling cycle; first factory then exposed group cycle OFF correctly. A separate cyborg run produced a new owned combat ID and repeated in its one available factory, preserving vehicles.",
    "Offline exact86: retained seeded Towers checkpoint verified ALL across five vehicle and five cyborg factories; real finished units, repeat, local STOP and group OFF were observed. Nine new trucks reached the ordinary15-truck cap. FFA normal prepared save passed four-factory vehicle production; Campaign normal prepared save passed three-factory vehicle production.",
    "First/second category controls, compact/enlarged actual Towers and Home screens passed. A real FFA finger pan after menu close changed native camera metadata with no held keys. Root also observed two actual Android keyboard openings and Back/cancel returns plus Research/Manufacturing navigation and explicit MP Return.",
    "Manual update current/offline/retry/offer-Back paths executed. A clearly labelled private lower-version client of current code downloaded all616662059 bytes from the live VPS once into an initially absent staging directory. SHA256 matched; the app passed real PackageManager app/version/minimumSDK/signer checks before reporting verified.",
    "Actual unknown-source Settings denial/back/allow, native installer Cancel/settled retry/Update approval, and system App updated occurred. Installed baseAPK SHA256 equals the exact candidate. All24 save ZIPs and eight preference files remained byte-identical before replacement, after replacement before launch, and after launch/manual latest0.86 check.",
    "After the replacement, a further real MP Home return advanced native clock6500ms and an Android finger swipe changed camera from10624,11392 to11588,11570. Explicit Leave/Back returned to normal Home and released the service. The later file comparison changes only WebView origins_visited_date bookkeeping; all user save/wallet/design/player contents remain unchanged.",
    "VPS public APK/feed are version86 with matching exact hash/size and intentional warzone2100-andriod.apk filename. HTTPS feed and APK range were verified, then the app verified the full public download. Existing Caddy/index guard hashes stayed unchanged during publication; no source, signing key or secrets were uploaded.",
    "Build and package integrity checks establish same appId/signature, exact source/APK assets, unchanged compiled engines/WASM/maps/music/native source, and only three append-only command VFS entries. All historical source members and v0.85 artifacts remain preserved; no GitHub release was published."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Headless Android16 emulator with CDP attached; physical handset/OEM behavior and indefinite background survival are unverified. No promise after force-stop, process death, lost network or an ended host match.",
    "Inherited emulator black-terrain/native asset warnings remain. No full campaign, all-map balance, exhaustive combat/gesture or live-ad run is claimed. Private unlisted official host was used; no public-room chat or live-user match testing.",
    "Towers used an existing disclosed seeded complete native facility checkpoint, not newly constructed five-factory setups. Its old normal phone-save fixture references a missing original wallet session and was correctly rejected; no wallet/guard changes forced acceptance. FFA retains its prepared legacy NullBot identity. Campaign checkpoint had no cyborg factory; multi-cyborg native evidence is Towers, with one MP cyborg factory also tested.",
    "Initial test fixture errors are retained: a live handoff was too strictly asserted busy, constructor-cap conditions needed native follow-up, and the original cyborg recipe filter mistook ZNULLCONSTRUCT for real equipment. These were diagnosed and corrected without product changes; successful focused follow-ups are separate evidence.",
    "The private test host exited after an idle match during tooling preparation. A fresh prepared private host was used for focused production; no long-duration connection claim is inferred from that expired fixture.",
    "Historical v0.85 has no updater. Actual update testing used a private current-code version85 client with the same identity; the preserved historical APK/source were never overwritten.",
    "Initial Android installation failed from constrained emulator storage. Android cache/staging cleanup and a temporary128MiB emulator low-storage reserve preceded a successful native approval; free space had already risen before the setting change, so causation is not attributed solely to it. No apps/saves/private game data were removed; original reserve, appop, network and display settings were restored.",
    "Updates are complete signed replacement APKs with Android approval. Smaller delta/code hot patches and silent installation are not implemented. Installation needs sufficient Android staging space.",
    "The final additional game visit changed WebView origins_visited_date, as retained in the post-game comparison. This normal bookkeeping difference is not hidden by restoring it; immediate update32/32 preservation and unchanged user-content files are separately proved."
  ],
